# A shell script in this repository is LF, whatever the computer's git does.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites text files on checkout. The scripts
# under docker/ are read by /bin/sh inside a Linux container, where a CRLF `set -e` is
# `set -e\r` — "Illegal option" — and the container exits before it starts the app (spec 216).
#
# Only *.sh is pinned. Pinning the whole tree would rewrite every file in an existing Windows
# checkout, and *.ps1 is the one consumer that wants CRLF.
*.sh text eol=lf
